	(text "Each control position is fitted per effect with a pot or a button: exactly one fit is placed per position.\nBoth fits are drawn (CR-PEDAL-POPULATION, variant positions; CR-PEDAL-CONTROL-NODE; open row CONTROL-POSITION-VARIANTS).\n- POS1: pot fit RV1; button fit SW1 with its pull-up R52; always fitted R53, R54, C49.\n- POS2: pot fit RV2; button fit SW2 with its pull-up R55; always fitted R56, R57, C50.\n- POS3: pot fit RV3; button fit SW3 with its pull-up R58; always fitted R59, R60, C51." (at 27.94 166.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9ac5ee33-c862-5582-9586-41e94e68b1ee"))
